			],
			"Message": "style(Rest): Normalize whitespace and redirection spacing across build scripts\n\nStandardize spacing around shell redirection operators (2> /dev/null), pipe delimiters, and input redirections (wc -c < \"file\") in Bench.sh, prepublishOnly.sh, and run_tests.sh. Collapse excess blank lines between import statements and function bodies in index.js and postinstall.js. Reformat prepublishOnly.sh case statements to a compact single-line-per-clause layout.\n\nAll changes are purely cosmetic with no functional impact on benchmark execution, binary detection, platform resolution, test runs, or npm publish workflows.",
