			"Message": "style(Rest): Normalize whitespace and formatting across build scripts\n\nRemove redundant spaces around redirection operators, standardize pipe spacing, and collapse unnecessary blank lines in Bench.sh, bin/Rest.js, index.js, postinstall.js, prepublishOnly.sh, and run_tests.sh.\n\nChanges include: replacing `2> /dev/null` with `2>/dev/null`, removing spaces around `>\"file\"` redirections, standardizing pipe delimiter spacing to single spaces, and collapsing excess blank lines between statements. The prepublishOnly.sh case statements are reformatted to a more compact layout.\n\nAll modifications are purely cosmetic with no functional impact on binary detection, platform resolution, benchmark execution, test runs, or npm publish workflows.",
